.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-release-pin 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-release\-pin \- Print the release batten.toml pins, in the working tree or at a revision
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten release pin\fR [\fB\-\-at\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print the release batten.toml pins, in the working tree or at a revision
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-at\fR \fI<at>\fR
Read the pin at this revision rather than the working tree
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
